{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30018_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:36964ddeeae6664f30d04b2d7849c96f3b2837fa44bf72b5108b5b18addda033",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0502268938cc7617094022ac19f695794b4154e3afcb0abc9572b58299f1893c",
      "text": "广播电台的嘉宾出演？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed2156417ee4c229488cc52041780135d3a6b21269f943bae0a24b00133387e2",
      "text": "是的！因为广告的反响非常好，\n对方务必想邀请各位出演。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29074d7f0608ce63cae58352bdb2d6fe2f38575504e2912a31b75e5138398a6a",
      "text": "听说是由前阵子拍摄广告的商品厂商赞助的\n节目，主要是通过那层关系促成的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:768e5f95148a02839d5f03c5d05fc641606937a5c30914597b6d776706287294",
      "text": "嘿～……还有解答听众来信咨询的\n问答环节啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d74962cc11c441a657b585c4ac30d2936b43842d1c610d7012de54ce72ae344",
      "text": "这次是要真正去给出恋爱建议呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f85f5417ea7befd53ede42b89290178c1215d820eaea44646b5da469377c83e",
      "text": "是的。而且是连续两周的安排。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20c40b1a9060d635d71b8ec195b2dcdf5e71942fa1c845e210329aacdcabb1c1",
      "text": "连续两周吗。那说明我们很受期待嘛！\n交给我们吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2428f666411db8f4786e58c0a9009a13f77328090054c14f3969aa0a6223142",
      "text": "是啊。看了那个广告之后萌生出想找我们\n商量的想法，真的让人很高兴呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:829c77e62eda825b47c52cac61b6ed1bcd95ecae94ab7e45889f8bb894f3a65b",
      "text": "为了那些在恋爱中烦恼的天使酱们，\n这份邀约，请务必让我们接下。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
